鲈鱼珀金斯在这里，
来找你直播

00:58.308 --> 01:02.353
from the Bikini Bottom Wrestling
Royal Rumble Free-For-All.
来自比基尼泳裤摔跤
皇家大战混战。

01:02.437 --> 01:03.938
Free?
自由的？

01:04.022 --> 01:05.315
Gimme-gimme-gimme.
给我给我给我。

01:05.398 --> 01:07.275
Gimme-gimme-gimme-gimme.
给我给我给我给我。

01:07.358 --> 01:09.944
Gimme... Gimme?
给我...给我？

01:10.028 --> 01:12.322
Gimme?
给我？

01:12.405 --> 01:14.574
Uh, what do I get?
呃，我能得到什么？

01:14.657 --> 01:16.117
Well, what you get
好吧，你得到什么

01:16.201 --> 01:19.162
is the most anticipated event
of the wrestling season.
是最值得期待的事件
摔跤赛季的。

01:19.245 --> 01:21.998
...Hundreds of wrestlers
from around the world
...数百名摔跤手
来自世界各地

01:22.081 --> 01:24.584
face off against
the heavyweight champs.
面对
重量级冠军。

01:43.228 --> 01:44.896
Perkins: Anyone who can
defeat these giants
帕金斯：任何有能力的人
击败这些巨人

01:44.979 --> 01:47.607
will earn
the championship title.
会赚到
冠军头衔。

01:47.690 --> 01:49.526
Big deal.
有什么大不了的。

01:49.609 --> 01:52.946
And the
million-dollar
cash prize.
还有
百万美元
现金奖。

01:54.155 --> 01:55.907
Million dollars...
百万美元...

01:55.990 --> 01:59.035
Cash prize?
现金奖励？

02:01.454 --> 02:02.789
Gimme-gimme-gimme-gimme...
给我给我给我给我...

02:02.872 --> 02:03.998
gimme-gimme-gimme-gimme-gimme.
给我给我给我给我给我。

02:08.545 --> 02:10.755
Krabs: Money-money-money...
蟹蟹：钱钱钱钱……

02:10.839 --> 02:12.757
Money-money-money-money...
钱钱钱钱钱……

02:12.841 --> 02:14.509
Money-money-money-money...
钱钱钱钱钱……

02:14.592 --> 02:16.636
Money, money.
钱，钱。

02:16.719 --> 02:19.430
Money, money, money.
钱，钱，钱。

02:19.806 --> 02:21.808
Money?
钱？

02:25.645 --> 02:26.646
Whoa... Ooh.
哇...哦。

02:28.523 --> 02:32.360
Fighter: My leg... My leg.
战士：我的腿……我的腿。

02:32.443 --> 02:36.614
No living soul should
suffer through what
I've witnessed here today.
任何活着的灵魂都不应该
经历什么
今天我在这里亲眼目睹。

02:36.698 --> 02:38.700
Except maybe...
除了也许...

02:40.785 --> 02:43.162
SpongeBob: Oh, where are
you taking us, Mr. Krabs?
海绵宝宝：噢，在哪里
蟹老板，你带我们去吗？

02:43.246 --> 02:44.080
Now go get 'em.
现在去抓他们吧。

02:46.791 --> 02:48.585
What do you think
the surprise is, Patrick?
你觉得怎么样
令人惊讶的是，帕特里克？

02:48.668 --> 02:50.628
Patrick: I don't know,
what do you think it is?
帕特里克：我不知道，
你认为它是什么？

02:50.712 --> 02:52.005
SpongeBob:
I don't know...
海绵宝宝：
我不知道...

02:52.088 --> 02:55.466
Whatever it is,
it's  really  big.
不管是什么，
它真的很大。

02:55.550 --> 02:58.636
Oh...
and hairy.
哦...
和毛茸茸的。

03:05.476 --> 03:07.145
And it smells angry.
而且闻起来很生气。

03:07.228 --> 03:08.605
Is it time to look yet?
是时候看看了吗？

03:08.688 --> 03:09.856
You peek first.
你先看一下。

03:09.939 --> 03:11.482
Patrick: No,
you peek first.
帕特里克：不，
你先看一下。

03:11.566 --> 03:12.942
Ooh!
哦！

03:21.409 --> 03:23.494
SpongeBob: Hey, who are
those guys, Mr. Krabs?
海绵宝宝：嘿，谁是
那些家伙，蟹老板？

03:23.578 --> 03:25.121
They look like
they wanna hurt us.
他们看起来像
他们想伤害我们。

03:25.204 --> 03:27.123
What, those two?
什么，那两个？

03:27.206 --> 03:28.374
Ah, they're harmless.
啊，它们是无害的。

03:28.458 --> 03:30.418
It's all just
part of the act.
这一切都只是
该法案的一部分。

03:30.501 --> 03:31.377
The act?
行为？

03:31.461 --> 03:33.212
Of course.
当然。

03:33.296 --> 03:35.006
They're just pretending.
他们只是假装而已。

03:35.089 --> 03:37.175
Pretending?
假装？

03:37.258 --> 03:39.093
We like pretending.
我们喜欢假装。

03:39.177 --> 03:41.471
: Ah, ah-ah-ah,
don't we all?
: 啊啊啊啊啊
我们都不是吗？

03:41.554 --> 03:42.597
Can we wear costumes?
我们可以穿戏服吗？

03:42.680 --> 03:44.974
Uh... Sure.
呃...当然。

03:45.058 --> 03:47.226
Hey, SpongeBob,
how do I look?
嘿，海绵宝宝，
我看起来怎么样？

03:47.310 --> 03:51.522
Wow, looks like those
iron bun workout videos
are really paying off.
哇，看起来像那些
铁包子锻炼视频
确实得到了回报。

03:51.606 --> 03:54.317
And two and three...
还有两个和三个...

03:54.400 --> 03:57.195
Video Instructor:
...and four steps closer
to your dream body.
视频导师：
...又近了四步
到你梦想的身体。

03:57.278 --> 03:59.322
Patrick: I could even
do it in my sleep.
帕特里克：我什至可以
在我睡梦中做。

04:03.618 --> 04:06.079
Wow, can we have
cool nicknames too?
哇，我们可以有
昵称也很酷？

04:06.162 --> 04:07.538
Oh, fine.
哦，好吧。

04:07.622 --> 04:09.540
You're the, uh,
"Short-Order Boy"
你是那个，呃，
《短期订单男孩》

04:09.624 --> 04:12.335
and he's, the,
uh, "Pink Patty."
他是，那个，
呃，“粉红帕蒂”。

04:13.378 --> 04:15.380
And together we are...
我们在一起...

04:15.463 --> 04:17.298
The Krusty Krushers.
库斯蒂·克鲁舍 (Krusty Krushers)。

04:17.382 --> 04:20.843
Now go out there and
wrestle me up a million dollars.
现在出去吧
跟我斗一百万美元。

04:24.847 --> 04:26.349
This is gonna be so fun.
这会很有趣。

04:26.432 --> 04:28.184
Yeah!
是的！

04:28.267 --> 04:29.769
Yeah!
是的！

04:29.852 --> 04:31.437
Yeah!
是的！

04:31.521 --> 04:33.564
Yeah!
是的！

04:33.648 --> 04:34.482
OK, we're ready.
好的，我们准备好了。

04:34.565 --> 04:36.776
Hm, oh, uh, yeah.
嗯，哦，呃，是的。

04:36.859 --> 04:38.319
Al, send the mic down.
艾尔，把麦克风放下来。

04:38.403 --> 04:40.613
We've got fresh meat.
我们有新鲜的肉。

04:40.697 --> 04:42.782
Actually, we're here
to fake wrestle.
其实我们就在这里
假摔跤。

04:42.865 --> 04:44.617
And to pretend wrestle.
并假装摔跤。

04:44.701 --> 04:46.703
Yeah, whatever
.
是的，无论如何
。

04:46.786 --> 04:49.872
In this corner,
we have the challengers:
在这个角落，
我们有挑战者：

04:49.956 --> 04:51.791
The Krusty Krushers.
库斯蒂·克鲁舍 (Krusty Krushers)。

04:59.674 --> 05:01.426
Oh...
excuse me.
哦...
对不起。

05:01.509 --> 05:03.136
You can do it.
你可以做到的。

05:03.219 --> 05:05.638
And on the opposite
side of the ring
而相反
环的一侧

05:05.722 --> 05:09.058
we have
the undefeated champions.
我们有
不败的冠军。

05:25.700 --> 05:28.077
♪ Happy thoughts
happy thoughts...♪
♪ 快乐的想法
快乐的想法...♪

05:30.163 --> 05:31.414
Did it just get
dark in here?
是不是刚拿到
这里很黑吗？

05:31.497 --> 05:33.708
Dark- I'm afraid
of the dark.
黑暗-我害怕
黑暗的。

05:33.791 --> 05:35.960
Don't be afraid,
it's just them.
别害怕，
只是他们。

05:37.962 --> 05:41.174
Oh, right, it's just those
guys we're gonna wrestle.
哦，对了，就是这些
伙计们，我们要摔跤。

05:41.257 --> 05:43.342
Hello,
fellow competitors.
你好，
竞争对手。

05:45.928 --> 05:47.430
What was that?
那是什么？

05:47.513 --> 05:50.767
Hm, that's "wrestlese"
for "you're dead meat."
嗯，这就是“摔跤”
因为“你已经死了”。

05:50.850 --> 05:52.101
I don't get it.
我不明白。

05:54.562 --> 05:56.147
Hey, look, Patrick.
嘿，看，帕特里克。

05:56.230 --> 05:58.357
It's Mr. Krabs
cheering us on.
这是蟹老板
为我们加油。

05:59.734 --> 06:01.069
Whoa.
哇哦。

06:01.152 --> 06:03.279
Patrick: Oh, hey, SpongeBob.
帕特里克：哦，嘿，海绵宝宝。

06:03.362 --> 06:06.365
SpongeBob: Hey, Patrick,
look, Patrick, it's a fist.
海绵宝宝：嘿，帕特里克，
看，帕特里克，这是一个拳头。

06:06.449 --> 06:08.201
A fist, where?
拳头，在哪里？

06:08.284 --> 06:10.119
Oh, yeah,
that's definitely a...
哦，是的，
那绝对是一个...

06:29.555 --> 06:30.598
Yeah!
是的！

06:30.681 --> 06:32.558
How fun was that?
那有多有趣？

06:32.642 --> 06:34.143
It was so
super-duper fun.
原来如此
超级有趣。

06:35.686 --> 06:36.562
Boom!
繁荣！

06:36.646 --> 06:37.730
Krabs: A-hem.
螃蟹：嗯哼。

06:37.814 --> 06:39.524
Did you need
something, Mr. Krabs?
你需要吗
有什么事吗，蟹老板？

06:39.607 --> 06:42.276
: Oh,
did I need something?
：哦，
我需要什么吗？

06:42.360 --> 06:43.736
Hm, let me think,
did I need something?
嗯，让我想想，
我需要什么吗？

06:43.820 --> 06:45.613
:
Yes, I need something!
：
是的，我需要一些东西！

06:45.696 --> 06:49.700
I need you two
to get back in there
and show 'em who's boss.
我需要你们两个
回到那里
并向他们展示谁是老大。

06:49.784 --> 06:51.202
Show 'em what
Short-Order Boy
向他们展示什么
短单男孩

06:51.285 --> 06:54.497
and Pink Patty
can really do.
和粉红帕蒂
真的可以做。

06:54.580 --> 06:55.748
Right.
正确的。

06:55.832 --> 06:57.917
Come on, Patrick,
let's show these two
来吧，帕特里克，
让我们展示这两个

06:58.000 --> 06:59.418
what they're messing with.
他们在搞什么。

06:59.502 --> 07:00.670
With pleasure.
荣幸。

07:00.753 --> 07:02.797
Let's do this!
让我们这样做吧！

07:02.880 --> 07:05.091
That's the million-dollar
winning spirit.
这就是百万元
胜利精神。

07:05.174 --> 07:09.262
SpongeBob: All right, you two,
no more messing around.
海绵宝宝：好吧，你们两个，
别再胡闹了。

07:09.345 --> 07:10.680
Do you see this?
你看到这个了吗？

07:10.763 --> 07:11.806
Just a spatula, right?
就一把铲子吧？

07:11.889 --> 07:13.266
Wrong!
错误的！

07:13.349 --> 07:15.852
Actually,
this represents your face
事实上，
这代表你的脸

07:15.935 --> 07:19.814
after I get through
mangling it!
当我通过之后
破坏它！

07:25.069 --> 07:27.071
There, you see that?
在那里，你看到了吗？

07:27.155 --> 07:29.907
It's not gonna be pretty
when I get done with ya.
不会很漂亮
当我和你说完的时候。

07:31.033 --> 07:32.451
Good one, SpongeBob.
好一个，海绵宝宝。

07:32.535 --> 07:33.828
Thanks, Patrick.
谢谢，帕特里克。

07:33.911 --> 07:35.079
Now you try
saying something
现在你试试
说某事

07:35.163 --> 07:36.289
intimidating
as well.
令人生畏的
以及。

07:36.372 --> 07:38.916
If any of you think  this  is bad
如果你们中有人认为这很糟糕

07:39.000 --> 07:42.128
wait'll I get my hands
on ya, huh... Yeah.
等我把手拿起来
对你来说，嗯...是的。

07:42.211 --> 07:44.797
I'm gonna, I'm gonna, huh...
我会，我会，嗯……

07:44.881 --> 07:47.049
Tear you to shreds like, uh...
把你撕成碎片就像，呃......

07:50.428 --> 07:52.763
Oh, come on!
哦，来吧！

07:52.847 --> 07:55.308
Oh, I got a paper cut,
paper cut, oh!
哦，我被纸割伤了，
剪纸哦！

07:55.391 --> 07:57.435
Patrick, are you OK?
帕特里克，你还好吗？

07:57.518 --> 07:59.437
Oh, oh, I'm fine.
哦，哦，我很好。

07:59.520 --> 08:01.272
I just like to suck
on my hand.
我就是喜欢吸
在我手上。

08:01.355 --> 08:02.648
Really? Me too.
真的吗？我也是。

08:02.732 --> 08:04.358
Mmm, mmm...
嗯嗯……

08:08.696 --> 08:10.281
: Ah!
：啊！

08:10.364 --> 08:12.867
Oh...
Now what?
哦...
现在怎么办？

08:21.751 --> 08:25.087
: That tickles.
: 好痒啊

08:31.594 --> 08:33.137
Good catch.
很好的收获。

08:37.433 --> 08:38.851
Look, I'm a...
瞧，我是一个...

08:47.610 --> 08:48.861
Both:  : Whoa...
两人：：哇……

09:17.265 --> 09:18.599
What are you
doing out there?
你是什么
在那里做什么？

09:18.683 --> 09:19.558
Fake wrestling.
假摔跤。

09:19.642 --> 09:21.102
OK.
好的。

09:21.185 --> 09:24.855
But you still have to try
to  win  in fake wrestling.
但你还是要尝试
在假摔跤中获胜。

09:24.939 --> 09:27.233
Mr. Krabs, we're having
so much fun.
蟹老板，我们有
太有趣了。

09:27.316 --> 09:29.735
Doesn't that
make us winners?
那不是吗
让我们成为赢家？

09:29.819 --> 09:31.862
Actually, it doesn't!
事实上，事实并非如此！

09:32.572 --> 09:35.574
OK, OK, look, just...
好吧，好吧，你看，只是……

09:35.658 --> 09:37.576
Hey, where'd they...
嘿，他们去哪儿了……

09:37.660 --> 09:39.996
Oh, no, not the...
哦，不，不是那个...

09:41.497 --> 09:45.209
Wow, now that's
a serious sleeper hold.
哇，现在是
严重的卧铺保持。

09:48.087 --> 09:49.213
Oh, hello,
Mr. Fluffy.
哦，你好，
蓬松先生。

09:53.968 --> 09:56.095
:
Da-ba-ba-dee-dah.
：
达-巴-巴-迪-达。

09:56.178 --> 09:59.307
Crowd: Aww...
众人：哇……

10:00.516 --> 10:02.101
Perkins: And it looks
like the champs
帕金斯：看起来
像冠军一样

10:02.184 --> 10:03.519
are ready to end it.
准备结束它。

10:03.602 --> 10:04.729
End it?
结束吗？

10:04.812 --> 10:06.230
Crowd:  :
End it, end it...
人群: :
结束吧，结束吧……

10:06.314 --> 10:08.107
Get up, get up you guys.
起来吧，你们起来吧。

10:08.190 --> 10:12.111
Yup, they're gonna leave
more than a mark with
this special move.
是的，他们要离开
超过一个标记
这个特殊的举动。

10:12.194 --> 10:15.114
The mother of all moves:
一切动作之母：

10:15.197 --> 10:16.907
The flying double-decker
会飞的双层飞机

10:16.991 --> 10:19.535
atomic head-butt
of destruction...
原子头撞
毁灭的...

10:19.618 --> 10:21.912
...with a spin.
...旋转。

10:23.164 --> 10:25.249
Come on,
come on, wake up.
来吧，
来吧，醒来吧。

10:25.333 --> 10:28.419
: A-one and two
：A-一和二

10:28.502 --> 10:30.087
and squeeze.
并挤压。

10:30.963 --> 10:33.466
Oh, who am I kidding?
哦，我在和谁开玩笑呢？

10:33.549 --> 10:34.633
Good-bye, money.
再见，钱。

10:34.717 --> 10:36.469
Squeeze.
挤。

10:37.803 --> 10:40.056
Good-bye, money  .
再见，钱。

10:41.849 --> 10:43.809
Oh, squeeze.
哦，挤一下。

10:43.893 --> 10:46.145
Both:  : Oh, no.
两人：：哦，不。

10:46.228 --> 10:47.146
Not iron buns.
不是铁包子。

10:58.032 --> 11:00.034
Ladies and gentlemen...
女士们，先生们...

11:00.117 --> 11:02.411
here are your
new champions.
这是你的
新冠军。

11:02.495 --> 11:04.497
Good-bye money...
New champions?
再见钱...
新冠军？

11:04.580 --> 11:05.664
That's right, skip.
没错，跳过。

11:05.748 --> 11:08.501
And the winners
of $1 million.
以及获奖者
100万美元。

11:08.584 --> 11:11.087
Hello, money!
你好，钱！

11:11.170 --> 11:13.964
Whoo-hoo, money,
sweet money.
呼呼，钱，
甜甜的钱。

11:14.048 --> 11:14.965
Or...
或者...

11:15.049 --> 11:16.008
Or?
或者？

11:16.092 --> 11:16.926
You can take what's behind
你可以拿走后面的东西

11:17.009 --> 11:18.260
curtain number two.
第二幕。

11:18.344 --> 11:19.553
Curtain number two?
二号幕布？

11:19.637 --> 11:22.056
Perkins: Make all your
dreams come true
帕金斯：让你的一切
梦想成真

11:22.139 --> 11:24.809
with one week at Wrestle Camp.
在摔跤营待一周。

11:24.892 --> 11:26.852
Like, we're really gonna
trade all this money for...
就像，我们真的会
用所有这些钱换...

11:26.936 --> 11:28.604
Wrestle Camp!
摔跤营！

11:28.687 --> 11:31.857
Both: Wrestle Camp,
Wrestle Camp, Wrestle Camp...
两者：摔跤营，
摔跤营，摔跤营……

11:31.941 --> 11:34.110
Wrestle Camp
it is.
摔跤营
是的。

11:41.283 --> 11:43.077
SpongeBob: See you
at Wrestle Camp, Mr. Krabs.
海绵宝宝：再见
在摔跤营，蟹老板。

11:57.425 --> 11:58.551
Next.
下一个。

11:58.634 --> 12:00.469
Oh, no.
哦，不。

12:00.553 --> 12:03.222
Hey, Quincy,
how's my favorite
money man?
嘿，昆西，
我最喜欢的怎么样
有钱人？

12:03.305 --> 12:05.850
SpongeBob, what can
I do for you?
海绵宝宝，能做什么
我为你做事？

12:05.933 --> 12:09.145
The new Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy cards
come out today.
新的人鱼男
和藤壶男孩卡
今天出来。

12:09.228 --> 12:11.730
So I need to take
out some "mo-nay".
所以我需要采取
出一些“mo-nay”。

12:13.107 --> 12:14.567
Let me see
your bank book.
让我看看
你的银行存折。

12:14.650 --> 12:15.818
Sure thing, Quincy,
sure thing.
当然，昆西，
当然。

12:17.069 --> 12:19.405
Nice bunnies.
不错的兔子。

12:19.488 --> 12:22.408
I know, I know,
it's so embarrassing.
我知道，我知道，
太尴尬了。

12:22.491 --> 12:23.826
: I wanted the one
with the kittens on it.
: 我想要一个
上面有小猫。

12:26.120 --> 12:27.455
Right.
正确的。

12:27.538 --> 12:29.165
Here you are, sir.
在这里，先生。

12:29.248 --> 12:30.916
Thank you.
谢谢。

12:31.000 --> 12:33.961
Hmm... Uh, Quincy?
嗯...呃，昆西？

12:34.044 --> 12:35.337
This one is wrinkled.
这个有皱纹。

12:35.421 --> 12:37.214
I couldn't possibly give
this to Mermaid Man.
我不可能给
这是给美人鱼人的。

12:37.298 --> 12:38.883
It simply won't do.
这根本行不通。

12:38.966 --> 12:43.095
I don't think they go directly
to Mermaid Man, SpongeBob.
我不认为他们会直接去
到美人鱼人、海绵宝宝。

12:43.179 --> 12:45.473
But, um...
但是，嗯...

12:45.556 --> 12:46.891
Here, try this one.
来，试试这个。

12:46.974 --> 12:48.851
Hm, uh...
嗯，呃...

12:48.934 --> 12:51.103
This one smells funny.
这个闻起来很有趣。

12:51.187 --> 12:53.564
Oh, come on,
would you hurry up?
哦，来吧，
你能快点吗？

12:53.647 --> 12:55.983
Yeah, some of us
have withdrawals
to make, you know?
是的，我们中的一些人
有提款
做，你知道吗？

12:59.069 --> 13:02.198
Well, I'll have  you  know
that this is for Mermaid Man
好吧，我会让你知道的
这是给美人鱼男人的

13:02.281 --> 13:04.158
and I'm not leaving
until I have money
我不会离开
直到我有钱为止

13:04.241 --> 13:06.202
that shows him
the proper respect.
这表明他
适当的尊重。

13:06.285 --> 13:07.912
Whoa!
哇！

13:07.995 --> 13:09.955
Oh!
哦！

13:10.039 --> 13:13.334
Patrick: One, two...
帕特里克：一，二……

13:13.417 --> 13:15.377
...three, four...
……三、四……

13:15.461 --> 13:16.754
Hey, Patrick.
嘿，帕特里克。

13:16.962 --> 13:18.756
Counting up your change
for a pack of Mermaid Man
计算你的零钱
for a pack of Mermaid Man

13:18.839 --> 13:20.466
and Barnacle Boy trading cards?
和藤壶男孩交易卡？

13:20.549 --> 13:24.386
No, I'm thinking about buying
this book on counting.
不，我正在考虑购买
这本书是关于计数的。

13:24.470 --> 13:26.764
Three, four...
三、四……

13:26.847 --> 13:29.850
What's gonna
happen next... Five?
会发生什么
接下来发生......五个？

13:29.934 --> 13:32.394
Holy super happy fun time,
this book's good.
神圣的超级快乐的欢乐时光，
这本书不错。

13:32.478 --> 13:34.271
I'll take it.
我要买它。

13:34.355 --> 13:36.482
One, two, three...
一二三...

13:36.565 --> 13:39.360
One pack of Mermaid Man and
Barnacle Boy cards, please.
一包美人鱼男和
请给藤壶男孩卡片。

13:39.443 --> 13:41.570
Five, six...
五、六……

13:41.654 --> 13:42.488
All right!
好的！

13:42.571 --> 13:44.323
Not so fast.
没那么快。

13:44.406 --> 13:45.908
Where's my dollar?
我的美元在哪里？

13:47.493 --> 13:48.953
Here you are, my good sir.
你来了，我的好先生。

13:49.036 --> 13:51.288
Here you go, kid.
给你，孩子。

13:51.372 --> 13:52.248
Patrick: 17...
帕特里克：17...

13:52.414 --> 13:55.834
SpongeBob: So shiny and smooth.
海绵宝宝：如此闪亮、光滑。

13:55.918 --> 13:58.254
Um-hm...
嗯嗯...

13:59.838 --> 14:00.881
Oh!
哦！

14:00.965 --> 14:01.840
: Uh, oh!
： 呃，哦！

14:01.924 --> 14:04.218
Ooh...
哦...

14:04.301 --> 14:08.973
Ooh, Mermaid Man's
bubble-powered wheelchair
from season 12.
哦，美人鱼男
气泡动力轮椅
从第12季开始。

14:11.976 --> 14:13.852
Holy scallops.
圣扇贝。

14:13.936 --> 14:15.437
It's the dentures
that Mermaid Man used
这是假牙
人鱼男用过的

14:15.521 --> 14:18.524
to pop the dirty bubble
in episode "Forever Two."
戳破肮脏的泡沫
在剧集“永远的两个”中。

14:18.607 --> 14:22.695
Wow, these must be the most
valuable cards in the world.
哇，这些一定是最
世界上有价值的卡片。

14:22.778 --> 14:24.530
I'll treasure them forever.
我会永远珍藏它们。

14:26.282 --> 14:28.158
Those cards aren't
worth nothing.
那些卡不是
一文不值。

14:28.242 --> 14:31.328
I wouldn't put those cards
in the spokes of my bike.
我不会放那些卡片
在我自行车的辐条上。

14:31.412 --> 14:34.540
Now if you wanna see
a card worth talking about
现在如果你想看
一张值得一谈的卡

14:34.623 --> 14:36.375
check this one out.
看看这个。

14:36.709 --> 14:42.381
This is the super rare
platinum hologram animated
talking card number 54.
这是超级稀有的
白金全息图动画
会说话的卡号54。

14:42.464 --> 14:44.925
Card Announcer:
Mermaid Man says...
卡播报员：
美人鱼男说……

14:45.009 --> 14:47.136
Buy more cards.
多买点卡。

14:47.219 --> 14:50.306
There are only
five in existence.
只有
现有五个。

14:50.389 --> 14:52.016
How much is it
for this one?
多少钱
对于这个？

14:52.099 --> 14:53.809
This one's just a display.
这只是一个显示器。

14:53.892 --> 14:57.396
If you want a real one you have
to buy as many packs as you can
如果你想要一件正品，你就有了
购买尽可能多的包

14:57.479 --> 14:59.148
and hope you get lucky.
并希望你幸运。

15:02.484 --> 15:04.987
Oh, I have a good feeling
about this one.
哦，我有一种很好的感觉
关于这个。

15:05.070 --> 15:09.575
Come on, and it's...
来吧，这是...

15:09.658 --> 15:11.160
Not there.
不在那里。

15:15.122 --> 15:17.249
: Neh... No.
： 呃……不。

15:33.932 --> 15:37.603
Oh, I'll never find card 54!
哦，我永远找不到54号牌了！

15:37.686 --> 15:40.898
Patrick: 96, 97...
帕特里克：96、97……

15:40.981 --> 15:43.859
90, uh... 8.
90，呃...8。

15:43.942 --> 15:46.528
99, 100.
99、100。
99、100。
99、100。
99、100。
99、100。
99、100。
99、100。

15:46.612 --> 15:49.865
Oh, I hate counting.
哦，我讨厌数数。

15:49.948 --> 15:51.992
Just give me what he's having.
只要给我他拥有的东西就可以了。

15:52.076 --> 15:55.329
Oh, boy, let's see
which card I got.
哦，孩子，让我们看看
我得到了哪张卡。

15:55.412 --> 15:57.039
Is this a good
card, SpongeBob?
这是一个好的
卡，海绵宝宝？

15:57.122 --> 15:59.041
No, it's just another...
不，这只是另一个...

15:59.124 --> 16:01.001
Mermaid Man says:
美人鱼男 说道：

16:01.085 --> 16:03.879
Buy more cards.
多买点卡。

16:03.962 --> 16:05.172
Number 54.
54号。

16:05.255 --> 16:07.257
That's the best card there is.
这是最好的卡。

16:07.341 --> 16:08.926
It sure does
the job all right.
确实如此
工作没问题。

16:10.469 --> 16:12.137
Patrick, you're picking
your teeth with it.
帕特里克，你在选
你的牙齿。

16:12.221 --> 16:14.056
I'm preventing gingivitis.
我正在预防牙龈炎。

16:15.641 --> 16:18.936
Patrick, that's
the ultra rare number 54
talking card.
帕特里克，那就是
极其罕见的数字54
会说话的卡。

16:19.019 --> 16:22.064
It's really valuable,
and there's only five
in existence and...
确实很有价值，
而且只有五个
存在并且...

16:27.903 --> 16:29.488
Wha-nah-nah, Patrick...
哇啦啦啦，帕特里克……

16:31.740 --> 16:33.117
So  now  do you understand
那么现在你明白了吗

16:33.409 --> 16:36.453
why you should take  really
good care of that card?
为什么你应该真正采取
那张卡好好保管吗？

16:36.537 --> 16:37.538
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

16:42.668 --> 16:44.753
I can't let anything
happen to that card.
我不能让任何事
发生在该卡上。

16:44.837 --> 16:46.171
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
would never forgive me.
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩
永远不会原谅我。

16:46.255 --> 16:48.465
Patrick, watch out!
帕特里克，小心！

16:51.093 --> 16:53.345
You almost
tripped on that crack.
你几乎
被那条裂缝绊倒了。

16:57.057 --> 17:00.018
Whoo, now watch
where you're going.
哇，现在看
你要去哪里。

17:00.102 --> 17:01.520
OK, thanks, buddy.
好的，谢谢，伙计。

17:06.692 --> 17:08.110
Patrick, look out!
帕特里克，小心！

17:16.577 --> 17:19.621
That was close.
那很接近了。

17:20.748 --> 17:22.541
Patrick, this is serious.
帕特里克，这很严重。

17:22.624 --> 17:24.877
You're carrying
precious cargo now.
你背着
现在珍贵的货物。

17:24.960 --> 17:27.963
You can't just wander aimlessly
around like you've been...
你不能漫无目的地闲逛
周围就像你曾经...

17:28.047 --> 17:30.424
What?
什么？

17:30.507 --> 17:31.467
The card!
卡！

17:41.226 --> 17:43.145
Patrick, why did you just
walk into Goo Lagoon?
帕特里克，你为什么刚才
走进古泻湖？

17:43.228 --> 17:48.067
SpongeBob, you can't
always expect my usual
brand of stupidity.
海绵宝宝，你不能
总是期待我平常的
愚蠢的品牌。

17:48.150 --> 17:51.320
I like to mix it up,
keep you on your toes.
我喜欢混合起来
让你保持警惕。

18:15.010 --> 18:17.513
Here we are,
home safe home.
我们在这里，
安全到家。

18:17.596 --> 18:19.556
And nothing happened
to the card.
然后什么也没发生
到卡上。

18:19.640 --> 18:20.766
Good job, SpongeBob.
干得好，海绵宝宝。

18:20.849 --> 18:22.476
Now let me
just get my keys.
现在让我
拿到我的钥匙。

18:22.559 --> 18:24.478
Nope.
没有。

18:24.561 --> 18:25.604
There you are.
你就在那里。

18:25.687 --> 18:27.022
I knew you were
in there somewhere.
我知道你是
在那儿的某个地方。

18:27.105 --> 18:29.650
The super rare
and priceless
超级稀有的
和无价的

18:29.733 --> 18:31.026
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
trading card.
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩
交易卡。

18:31.235 --> 18:33.195
Patrick, where is it,
where is it?
帕特里克，它在哪里，
它在哪里？

18:33.278 --> 18:35.072
Dear Neptune.
亲爱的海王星。

18:35.155 --> 18:37.825
You didn't put it in
your pocket, did you?
你没有把它放进去
你的口袋，是吗？

18:37.908 --> 18:39.159
It's getting all bent up!
都快弯起来了！

18:39.243 --> 18:42.162
Bent up, bent up.
弯起来了，弯起来了。

18:42.246 --> 18:43.580
: Bent up.
: 弯起来了。

18:43.664 --> 18:45.457
Bent, bent,
bent, bent up.
弯了，弯了，
弯曲，弯曲起来。

18:45.541 --> 18:47.543
Sheesh, don't
get your pants
希希，别这样
拿你的裤子

18:47.626 --> 18:49.837
up in a square knot,
SpongeBob.
打成方结，
海绵宝宝。

18:49.920 --> 18:53.090
I don't even believe in pockets.
我什至不相信口袋。

18:53.173 --> 18:56.718
I keep everything
I need right here:
我保留一切
我需要在这里：

18:56.802 --> 18:58.595
In the folds of my back fat.
在我背部脂肪的褶皱里。

19:00.013 --> 19:02.724
You seem to be pretty fond
of this little thing.
看来你很喜欢
这件小事。

19:02.808 --> 19:05.144
Why don't you
just keep it?
你为什么不
就保留它吗？

19:08.063 --> 19:09.857
You mean...
你的意思是...

19:09.940 --> 19:12.568
you'd give me your most
valuable possession?
你会给我你最多的
有价值的财产？

19:12.651 --> 19:15.487
I'd give you my most
valuable possession?
我愿意给你我最大的
有价值的财产？

19:19.199 --> 19:20.951
You're the best
pal ever.
你是最好的
曾经的朋友。

19:21.034 --> 19:22.035
I'm the best pal ever!
我是有史以来最好的朋友！

19:22.119 --> 19:24.997
But can you
do me one favor?
但你可以吗
帮我一个忙吗？

19:25.080 --> 19:27.165
Sure, pal,
anything for you.
当然，朋友，
为你做任何事情。

19:27.249 --> 19:30.836
Do you mind if I hold
onto it just for today?
你介意我持有吗
就为了今天吗？

19:30.919 --> 19:33.672
Um... Sure, Patrick.
嗯...当然，帕特里克。

19:33.755 --> 19:37.342
Oh, good, 'cause my landlord
changed the lock again.
哦，太好了，因为我的房东
又换了锁。

19:39.636 --> 19:41.179
Patrick, wait,
let me call a locksmith.
帕特里克，等等，
让我打电话给锁匠。

19:41.263 --> 19:43.473
Oh, I don't need
any old locksmith.
哦，我不需要
任何一个老锁匠。

19:43.557 --> 19:44.683
But Patrick?
但是帕特里克？

19:44.766 --> 19:46.101
Don't!
不！

19:46.184 --> 19:47.185
Patrick!
帕特里克！

19:47.519 --> 19:48.854
But Patrick,
don't you think maybe...
但是帕特里克，
你不觉得也许...

19:50.272 --> 19:51.607
That you
shouldn't...
那个你
不应该...

19:53.192 --> 19:55.402
Oh!
哦！

19:55.485 --> 19:57.529
Man, this card is fantastic.
伙计，这张卡太棒了。

19:59.281 --> 20:02.034
Breaking and entering
sure makes a fella hungry.
破门而入
肯定会让一个人感到饥饿。

20:02.117 --> 20:03.911
Hey, why don't
we eat some dinner
嘿，为什么不呢
我们吃晚饭

20:03.994 --> 20:06.288
and then I'll
give you your card?
然后我会
给你你的卡吗？

20:09.249 --> 20:12.669
Ew, this barbecue's
really filthy.
呃，这个烧烤
真的很脏。

20:12.753 --> 20:14.671
Oh, but this'll
take care of it.
哦，但这会
照顾好它。

20:14.755 --> 20:16.632
No, Patrick, wait,
allow me to clean it.
不，帕特里克，等等，
请允许我清理它。

20:16.715 --> 20:19.885
Now, now, SpongeBob,
I know you wanna help
现在，现在，海绵宝宝，
我知道你想帮忙

20:19.968 --> 20:21.803
but you're my guest.
但你是我的客人。

20:29.019 --> 20:31.647
There... Nice and shiny.
那里……漂亮又闪亮。

20:42.157 --> 20:44.618
Patrick, that card,
it's on fire!
帕特里克，那张卡片，
它着火了！

20:44.701 --> 20:46.828
Oh, yeah, yeah,
I'll take care of it.
哦，是啊，是啊，
我会处理的。

20:46.912 --> 20:48.747
There.
那里。

20:48.830 --> 20:50.457
Good as new.
完好如新。

20:50.540 --> 20:51.708
Ew.
呃。

20:55.963 --> 20:57.673
Dinner is served.
晚餐供应。

21:06.515 --> 21:07.766
: More cards...
: 更多卡...

21:10.811 --> 21:12.854
Oh, that hit the spot.
噢，这正是切中要害的。

21:12.938 --> 21:13.855
Pardon me.
对不起。

21:15.607 --> 21:17.401
Ah.
啊。

21:17.484 --> 21:18.652
Hey, look at that.
嘿，看看那个。

21:20.654 --> 21:23.031
Sundown already?
已经日落了吗？

21:23.115 --> 21:25.701
Well, you can
have your card now.
嗯，你可以
现在就有你的卡了。

21:25.784 --> 21:28.245
I hope you get as much
use out of it as I have.
我希望你能得到同样多的东西
像我一样使用它。

21:30.163 --> 21:33.000
Mermaid Man: ...More cards.
人鱼男：……更多的牌。

21:34.501 --> 21:37.671
Oh... It's ruined!
哎呀……毁了！

21:47.472 --> 21:50.392
SpongeBob,
what's wrong?
海绵宝宝，
怎么了？

21:50.475 --> 21:53.395
Now I'll never have
Mermaid Man card number 54-
现在我永远不会有
人鱼男卡号54-

21:53.478 --> 21:55.355
the special talking one.
特别会说话的人。

21:55.439 --> 21:57.315
Aw, sure you will.
哦，当然你会的。

21:57.399 --> 21:58.900
No, no.
不，不。

21:58.984 --> 22:03.155
I spent all my money
and, and, and...
我花光了所有的钱
还有，还有，还有……

22:03.238 --> 22:06.324
You bought the last pack.
你买了最后一包。

22:06.408 --> 22:09.494
So there's no more left
in all of Bikini Bottom.
所以已经没有剩下的了
在所有比基尼底部。

22:09.578 --> 22:11.496
Well, what about these?
嗯，那这些呢？

22:11.580 --> 22:13.957
Mermaid Man says:
美人鱼男 说道：

22:14.041 --> 22:16.793
Buy more cards.
多买点卡。

22:16.877 --> 22:19.046
Number 54.
54号。

22:19.129 --> 22:20.630
Patrick,
where did you get these?
帕特里克，
你从哪里得到这些的？

22:20.714 --> 22:23.550
Well, that one pack
I bought was filled with 'em.
嗯，那一包
我买的里面装满了。

22:25.594 --> 22:27.471
There'll all
yours, buddy.
都会有
你的，伙计。

22:27.554 --> 22:28.889
See you tomorrow.
明天见。

22:28.972 --> 22:30.390
Wow!
哇！

22:30.474 --> 22:31.683
Uh, hey, SpongeBob?
呃，嘿，海绵宝宝？

22:31.767 --> 22:33.685
Can I borrow one
of those cards?
我可以借一个吗
那些卡？

22:33.769 --> 22:36.605
I locked myself
out of my house again.
我把自己锁起来
再次离开我家。

我把自己锁起来
再次离开我家。